//api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":16,"created_at":"2025-07-31T18:17:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T07:38:53Z","closed_at":"2025-08-27T18:44:18Z","assignee":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduceable in Godot v4.5.dev5 as this is the first version with abstract classes I don't think it would be reproduceable elsewhere :).\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900K (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen working with abstract classes I tried to create a node of type abstract class, which I then wanted to extend, because an abstract class instantiation doesn't make much sense. \nI noticed when I right clicked on the node I could not attach a script to extend the functionality like I wanted.\nSee here:\n\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"316\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2695c77-f31c-4e01-b787-fcf3da401e6b\" />\n\nThen I noticed the script was set to some null or empty value in the inspector. See here:\n\n<img width=\"396\" height=\"444\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55b41c5d-287b-4546-a7df-15b52bbc6982\" />\n\nWhen \"undo\"ing this it started working as I would have originally have expected. See here:\n\n<img width=\"443\" height=\"337\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f8f9ad3-9f21-4d98-8dd6-5b29c20260a1\" />\n\nI think a much friendlier option instead of someone having to figure this out would be to maybe add a warning icon for abstract classes that are created this way.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene with a Node object.\n2. Create an abstract class with some gdscript.\n3. Attach a second script to the node root have it extend the abstract class\n4. Create a new child node and select the abstract class as it's type\n5. Right click on the child node, the extend and attach script options will be missing\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_bug_report.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21535535/MRP_bug_report.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109171/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}